                        <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">Played across two legs in November 2026 — first in Bouaké and then at the Independence Stadium in Bakau — the tie is a test of squad depth, tactical discipline, and home advantage. With qualifying points on the line, neither side can afford to drop a result.</p>

